  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supp&apos;t to the regional peace and development advis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint UNDP/DPPA Program (JP) works in delivering technical support to UN organizations that implement conflict prevention and peacebuilding initiatives. To this end Ireland will contribute to extension of the contract of the Regional Peace and Development Advisor, who is embedded within the UN Office of the Special Envoy for the Horn of Africa. The core obejective of the advisor is strengthening the nexus between peace and development through various joint initiatives to foster social cohesion, democratic governance, and inclusive political transitions in the region within the UN Prevention and Integration Strategy for the Horn of Africa framework.</narrative>
  </description>
